# The workbench image is built from a checkout (Dockerfile.workbench, COPY . /src):
# nothing of the operator's machine goes into it. The clone's history and remote
# (.git, whose config may carry a credential), any environment file but the
# versioned examples, npm credentials, and dependencies installed locally (the
# image installs its own from the lockfile).
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/*.env
!**/*.env.example
**/.npmrc
# Private keys and certificates with their key.
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/node_modules
